{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13738","headline":"梁广画花歌 · 顾况","name":"梁广画花歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王母欲过刘彻家，飞琼夜入云軿车。\n紫书分付与青鸟，却向人间求好花。\n上元夫人最小女，头面端正能言语。\n手把梁生画花看，凝嚬掩笑心相许。\n心相许，爲白阿娘从嫁与。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}